{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02435",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 4.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.42,
      "end_seconds": 17.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a shaky feeling in my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.3,
      "end_seconds": 21.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.19,
      "end_seconds": 29.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "For about a week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.75,
      "end_seconds": 32.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "What brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.6,
      "end_seconds": 37.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I notice it more with stress and caffeine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.5,
      "end_seconds": 41.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.52,
      "end_seconds": 62.5,
      "duration_seconds": 19.98,
      "text": "It usually comes with sweaty palms. Erm, as for sweaty palms, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. With sweaty palms, honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.52,
      "end_seconds": 68.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Right, has there been butterflies in your stomach too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.97,
      "end_seconds": 75.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. With butterflies in my stomach, mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.55,
      "end_seconds": 94.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "How about palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.78,
      "end_seconds": 97.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.41,
      "end_seconds": 103.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Have you noticed weakness, weight loss or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.51,
      "end_seconds": 106.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.14,
      "end_seconds": 110.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.95,
      "end_seconds": 116.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.49,
      "end_seconds": 119.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.56,
      "end_seconds": 122.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.84,
      "end_seconds": 125.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.67,
      "end_seconds": 129.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "No surgery, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.46,
      "end_seconds": 134.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.81,
      "end_seconds": 140.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.24,
      "end_seconds": 142.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.5,
      "end_seconds": 163.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.72,
      "end_seconds": 171.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.81,
      "end_seconds": 178.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.35,
      "end_seconds": 187.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.7,
      "end_seconds": 191.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.02,
      "end_seconds": 197.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.87,
      "end_seconds": 201.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.75,
      "end_seconds": 205.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.8,
      "end_seconds": 210.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.27,
      "end_seconds": 217.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.29,
      "end_seconds": 223.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.55,
      "end_seconds": 228.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Milk. I come out in... well, stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.13,
      "end_seconds": 246.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.36,
      "end_seconds": 259.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.16,
      "end_seconds": 288.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, pulse 77, blood pressure 117 over 73, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.83,
      "end_seconds": 292.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.19,
      "end_seconds": 296.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.29,
      "end_seconds": 300.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.79,
      "end_seconds": 302.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.81,
      "end_seconds": 305.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Right, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.01,
      "end_seconds": 330.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "There is a fine, fast tremor that goes away when the hands are resting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.59,
      "end_seconds": 357.63,
      "duration_seconds": 24.04,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Putting it all together, it points towards an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. We should do a thyroid test for tremor. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Cut down caffeine and try slow breathing when it starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.19,
      "end_seconds": 372.45,
      "duration_seconds": 14.26,
      "text": "Understood. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. We'll catch up in four weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.12,
      "end_seconds": 378.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}